# Google Sheets live sync
#
# Steps to enable:
# 1. Open your Google Sheet
# 2. File → Share → Share with others → Anyone with the link → Viewer → Done
# 3. Paste the CSV export URL below (include gid= if using a specific tab)

SHEET_CSV_URL=https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/1tBzP8GQGoFGD7dzS6jfTEyohukcsIuoJUSd5ntNYn2I/export?format=csv&gid=1335675092

# Expected sheet columns (row 1 = headers — column names are flexible):
# Company Name | Industry | Founded | Size | Revenue | Location |
# Contact Name | Contact Title | Contact Email |
# Automation Opportunities  <-- semicolons between ops: "op1; op2; op3"
# Email Doc Link | Status | Last Contacted | Follow-Up Date | Notes |
# Automation Score  <-- 1-10, add this column so the gauge works
